cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ISOSTER: ISOphote on STERoid"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-18
repository-code: "https://github.com/MassiveSeaOtters/isoster"
abstract: >-
  Accelerated Python library for elliptical isophote fitting in galaxy images.
  Runs tens of times faster than photutils.isophote (median 45x across a
  237-configuration synthetic Sersic sweep) using vectorized path-based
  sampling via scipy's map_coordinates.
authors:
  - family-names: "Huang"
    given-names: "Song" 
    orcid: "0000-0003-1385-7591"          
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - isophote fitting
  - galaxy photometry
  - ellipse fitting
